    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Lābhasakkārasilokena abhibhūto pariyādiṇṇacitto, bhikkhave, devadatto saṅghaṁ bhindi. ",
      "english": "Devadatta split the Saṅgha because his mind was overcome and overwhelmed by possessions, honor, and popularity. "
    },
